{"path":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/cadgpt.ca","gitRoot":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/cadgpt.ca","head":"4c5ed3e7ccaa76f8b8ddac1caef213c33cd927c2","dirtyLines":27,"installed":{"@builder.io/qwik":{"name":"@builder.io/qwik","version":"1.19.2"}},"instructions":[{"path":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/cadgpt.ca/AGENTS.md","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n## Commands\n\n- **Dev:** `bun run dev` (Vite SSR mode)\n- **Build (both steps required):** `bun run build && bun run build.server` — `build` alone only produces the client bundle\n- **Typecheck:** `bun run build.types` (runs `tsc --incremental --noEmit`)\n- **Lint:** `bun run lint` — only covers `src/**/*.ts*`; `convex/` has no linting\n- **Format:** `bun run fmt` / `bun run fmt.check`\n- **Start prod:** `bun server/entry.node-server.js`\n- **Secrets:** `just secrets` (or `mise run secrets`) — populates `.env.local` from fnox vault\n\n## Landmines\n\n- **convex-qwik Vite aliases are mandatory.** The package ships pre-built `.qwik.mjs` with un-inlined `$()`/`component$()` calls that the Qwik optimizer must transform at build time. `vite.config.ts` aliases every subpath import to the TS source. **If you add a new `convex-qwik/whatever` import, add a matching alias** or the build silently produces broken un-optimized output.\n\n- **Don't add BetterAuth lifecycle triggers.** `convex/auth.ts` intentionally omits `onCreate`/`onUpdate`/`onDelete` because wiring them causes circular type inference (`authComponent` references its own `internal.auth.*` triggers API). Profile creation is handled lazily by `ensureProfile` instead.\n\n- **Env var split: Vite vs Convex.** `PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL` and other `PUBLIC_`-prefixed vars go in `.env.local` (Vite inlines at build time). API keys and secrets live on the Convex deployment via `bunx convex env set <key> <value>`. Putting a secret in `.env.local` won't make it available inside Convex actions.\n\n- **JWKS one-time bootstrap.** After first `bunx convex dev`, run: `bunx convex run auth:generateJwk | bunx convex env set JWKS`. Without this, all authenticated Convex queries fail.\n\n- **`server/` is generated.** Don't edit anything in `server/` — `bun run build.server` wipes and regenerates it.\n\n- **Build needs PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL.** The Dockerfile sets it as a build arg. Running `bun run build` without it in `.env.local` produces a client that can't reach Convex.\n"}]}
